## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM has no profile: `benchlm.ai/models/grok-4-fast` returns HTTP 404 (the site's xAI index lists Grok 4.6/4.5/4.20 but not this checkpoint's rows).
- llm-stats.com/models/grok-4-fast and benchmarklist.com (67 "matched scores") render their tables client-side — no primary figure is present in the served HTML.
- Artificial Analysis has a model page for "Grok 4 Fast (non-reasoning)" but its numbers are also client-rendered.
- The vendor model card exists (`data.x.ai/2025-09-19-grok-4-fast-model-card.pdf`) but its benchmark tables are charts, not extractable numbers, and the PDF was not reachable as text in this pass.
- Resolution: no score is asserted rather than guessing from the Grok 4 chart; re-run this folder with a PDF-capable fetch of the model card.

